'''Koreasat 5''' (also known as '''ANASIS-I''' ('''A'''rmy '''N'''avy '''A'''ir Force '''S'''atellite '''I'''nformation '''S'''ystem'''-I''') and '''Mugunghwa 5''' (무궁화 5호)) is a South Korean [[communications satellite]] operated by [[KT Corporation|Koreasat]].<ref>[https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=2006-034A KoreaSat 5] at NSSDCA</ref><ref>Sadeh, Eligar (2010) [https://books.google.com/books?id=_mTFBQAAQBAJ&dq=Koreasat ''The Politics of Space''] Taylor & Francis {{ISBN|9781136884245}}</ref>

